  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the Humvee as the subject of the degrading comparison",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the Humvee (VisualMaterial entity) as the object being mocked through the textual comparisons. The meme invites the user to imagine themselves in the cramped interior (legroom of a pinto) or to perceive the vehicle's size (size of a shuttle bus) as absurdly disproportionate, thereby projecting the user's own experience or perspective onto the vehicle as the target of the joke. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the implied audience is the user viewing the meme, who is positioned as the one experiencing or imagining the humor derived from the vehicle's perceived inadequacies.",
